            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Retrospective analysis of primary and secondary coronaroventriculography was conducted in 283 patients, to whom coronary stenting and coronary shunting were performed. Further course of coronary atherosclerosis was investigated in patients after intervention on coronary arteries.</AbstractText>
